d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚雨中隐几偶书寄圣俞五首 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"如闻蛮服愚弄兵，凶酋恃险愁孤城。\n军书插羽惧不急，安得良术吹天晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39995,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚雨中隐几偶书寄圣俞五首 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"穷秋未穷草木衰，里人过半单裳衣。\n谷中吹律不可待，上天爱日何时辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39996,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚雨中隐几偶书寄圣俞五首 其四","author":"刘敞","text":"我欲乘桴渡南溟，手携水伯趋蓬瀛。\n秋来雨多蛟蜃喜，满目愁见风涛生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39997,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晚雨中隐几偶书寄圣俞五首 其五","author":"刘敞","text":"安得独上昆崙巅，侧身常近清阳边。\n氛妖堕散昏垫解，使我目朗心萧然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39998,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]